<title>UK: TENNIS-BOURNEMOUTH INTERNATIONAL SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BOURNEMOUTH INTERNATIONAL SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOURNEMOUTH, England 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results of the Bournemouth International men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>8-Kevin Goellner (Germany) beat 3-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) 2-6 7-5 6-4.  </p>
<p>1-Alberto Costa (Spain) beat Magnus Norman (Sweden) 4-6 6-2 6-3</p>
